[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4702772995","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120283#issuecomment-4702772995","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120283","id":4702772995,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGE6fAw","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-14T19:14:39Z","updated_at":"2026-06-14T19:14:39Z","body":"You should not expect `window_get_mode` to return specific value immediately after `window_set_mode`, changing mode take some time.\n\n`EXCLUSIVE_FULLSCREEN` is any window with client area (main viewport) exactly matching the screen, so if window after `DisplayServer.WINDOW_MODE_WINDOWED` is placed in such way it is matching screen area, Windows will force it back to full-screen. In case of normal window it probably should be adjusted to fit decorations to the screen, for borderless window this is expected behavior.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4702772995/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4703009719","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120283#issuecomment-4703009719","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120283","id":4703009719,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGFI7tw","user":{"login":"Whebon","id":61908025,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTA4MDI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61908025?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Whebon","html_url":"https://github.com/Whebon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Whebon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Whebon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Whebon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Whebon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Whebon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Whebon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Whebon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Whebon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Whebon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-14T20:49:18Z","updated_at":"2026-06-14T20:49:18Z","body":"Fair, it could take some time before the window mode gets updated, but even if I print `window_get_mode` in process, it keeps returning `EXCLUSIVE_FULLSCREEN`.\n\nOne of the goals is to switch from full screen to windowed mode with a different resolution (e.g. full screen 1920x1080 -> windowed 800x600). But that also seems to be impossible if the game was launched with the project settings described earlier.\n\nAbout borders, I am using a normal window, so no borderless window.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/iss